{"page":183,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"176","words":[{"text":"176","x":169,"y":139,"width":73,"height":34}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":560,"y":142,"width":132,"height":25},{"text":"03","x":704,"y":142,"width":35,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":774,"y":148,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":821,"y":144,"width":138,"height":29},{"text":"계층","x":971,"y":143,"width":54,"height":30}]},{"text":"시스템에서 동작하는 두 프로세스 간의 전달 서비스로 확장제는 것이다. “호스트-대-","words":[{"text":"시스템에서","x":538,"y":270,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"동작하는","x":728,"y":271,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":882,"y":272,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스","x":931,"y":270,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"간의","x":1087,"y":270,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"전달","x":1170,"y":270,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"서비스로","x":1253,"y":270,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"확장제는","x":1405,"y":270,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1560,"y":270,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"“호스트-대-","x":1688,"y":270,"width":202,"height":39}]},{"text":"호스트 전달-”을 “프로세스-대-프로세스 전달”로 확장하는 것을 트랜스포트 다중화","words":[{"text":"호스트","x":537,"y":331,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"전달-”을","x":663,"y":330,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"“프로세스-대-프로세스","x":801,"y":329,"width":390,"height":38},{"text":"전달”로","x":1212,"y":329,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"확장하는","x":1347,"y":329,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":1510,"y":329,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1595,"y":329,"width":181,"height":37},{"text":"다중화","x":1794,"y":327,"width":100,"height":48}]},{"text":"(transport multiplexing)와 역디중\u0026Hdemultiplcxing)라고 부른다. 다음 절에서 이들","words":[{"text":"(transport","x":535,"y":394,"width":157,"height":37},{"text":"multiplexing)와","x":709,"y":389,"width":255,"height":41},{"text":"역디중\u0026Hdemultiplcxing)라고","x":981,"y":388,"width":492,"height":41},{"text":"부른다.","x":1489,"y":389,"width":113,"height":38},{"text":"다음","x":1622,"y":390,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"절에서","x":1710,"y":388,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"이들","x":1829,"y":391,"width":62,"height":43}]},{"text":"을 살펴볼 것이다. UDP와 TCP는 헤더에 오류 검출 필드를 포함함으로써 무결성 김사","words":[{"text":"을","x":535,"y":449,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"살펴볼","x":583,"y":449,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":704,"y":448,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"UDP와","x":829,"y":448,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"TCP는","x":958,"y":450,"width":110,"height":35},{"text":"헤더에","x":1082,"y":448,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"오류","x":1199,"y":450,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"검출","x":1284,"y":448,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"필드를","x":1367,"y":449,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"포함함으로써","x":1483,"y":450,"width":210,"height":38},{"text":"무결성","x":1709,"y":449,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"김사","x":1830,"y":451,"width":61,"height":43}]},{"text":"를 제공한다. 이러한 최소한의 두 가지 트랜스포트 계층 서비스(프로세스 대 프로세스","words":[{"text":"를","x":534,"y":510,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"제공한다.","x":584,"y":509,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":749,"y":509,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"최소한의","x":869,"y":508,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":1023,"y":510,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"가지","x":1074,"y":508,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1157,"y":509,"width":175,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":1348,"y":509,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"서비스(프로세스","x":1432,"y":510,"width":261,"height":39},{"text":"대","x":1709,"y":510,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스","x":1757,"y":512,"width":131,"height":37}]},{"text":"데이터 전달과 오류 검출)가 UDP가 제공하는 유일한 두 가지 서비스이다. 여기서","words":[{"text":"데이터","x":535,"y":568,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"전달과","x":661,"y":568,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"오류","x":783,"y":570,"width":71,"height":34},{"text":"검출)가","x":875,"y":568,"width":121,"height":38},{"text":"UDP가","x":1013,"y":568,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"제공하는","x":1151,"y":568,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"유일한","x":1311,"y":569,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1437,"y":572,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":1491,"y":571,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"서비스이다.","x":1581,"y":570,"width":188,"height":38},{"text":"여기서","x":1792,"y":570,"width":93,"height":46}]},{"text":"UDP는 IP와 같이 HI:소!되적인 서비스이다. UDP는 하나의 프로세스에 의해서 전송된","words":[{"text":"UDP는","x":532,"y":631,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"IP와","x":662,"y":628,"width":72,"height":36},{"text":"같이","x":749,"y":627,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"HI:소!되적인","x":834,"y":627,"width":173,"height":43},{"text":"서비스이다.","x":1025,"y":628,"width":184,"height":38},{"text":"UDP는","x":1226,"y":632,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"하나의","x":1357,"y":631,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1477,"y":632,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"의해서","x":1672,"y":631,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"전송된","x":1793,"y":632,"width":93,"height":44}]},{"text":"데이터가 손상되지 않고(일부 또는 데이터 전부) 목적지 프로세스에 도착한다는 것을","words":[{"text":"데이터가","x":533,"y":688,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"손상되지","x":686,"y":687,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"않고(일부","x":843,"y":687,"width":154,"height":40},{"text":"또는","x":1013,"y":690,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"데이터","x":1100,"y":689,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"전부)","x":1222,"y":689,"width":81,"height":39},{"text":"목적지","x":1319,"y":691,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1442,"y":693,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"도착한다는","x":1634,"y":692,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":1828,"y":694,"width":60,"height":41}]},{"text":"보장하지 않는다. UDP는 3.3절에서 자세하게 다룬다.","words":[{"text":"보장하지","x":529,"y":749,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"않는다.","x":683,"y":748,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"UDP는","x":811,"y":750,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"3.3절에서","x":939,"y":749,"width":153,"height":37},{"text":"자세하게","x":1109,"y":749,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"다룬다.","x":1265,"y":750,"width":113,"height":39}]},{"text":"반면에, TCP는 애플리게이션에 몇 가지 추가적인 서비스를 제공한다. 가장 먼저","words":[{"text":"반면에,","x":598,"y":809,"width":112,"height":37},{"text":"TCP는","x":727,"y":811,"width":111,"height":35},{"text":"애플리게이션에","x":854,"y":809,"width":243,"height":39},{"text":"몇","x":1119,"y":810,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":1169,"y":811,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"추가적인","x":1254,"y":812,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":1414,"y":813,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1571,"y":814,"width":150,"height":38},{"text":"가장","x":1742,"y":813,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"먼저","x":1826,"y":815,"width":58,"height":42}]},{"text":"TCP는 신뢰적인 데이터껸달(reliable data transfer)을 제공한다. 흐름제어, 순서번","words":[{"text":"TCP는","x":525,"y":872,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"신뢰적인","x":652,"y":869,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"데이터껸달(reliable","x":810,"y":870,"width":334,"height":39},{"text":"data","x":1157,"y":876,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"transfer)을","x":1247,"y":874,"width":190,"height":38},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1454,"y":875,"width":148,"height":37},{"text":"흐름제어,","x":1622,"y":875,"width":151,"height":38},{"text":"순서번","x":1791,"y":874,"width":95,"height":43}]},{"text":"호, 확인응답, 타이머(이 장에서 이러한 기술을 자세히 다룬다)를 사용함으로써 TCP는","words":[{"text":"호,","x":525,"y":931,"width":43,"height":37},{"text":"확인응답,","x":583,"y":930,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"타이머(이","x":747,"y":931,"width":151,"height":40},{"text":"장에서","x":914,"y":931,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":1035,"y":932,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"기술을","x":1155,"y":932,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"자세히","x":1272,"y":933,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"다룬다)를","x":1393,"y":935,"width":154,"height":39},{"text":"사용함으로써","x":1560,"y":935,"width":211,"height":39},{"text":"TCP는","x":1786,"y":939,"width":101,"height":39}]},{"text":"송신하는 프로세스로부터 수신하는 프로세스에게 데이터가 순서대로 정확하게 전달되","words":[{"text":"송신하는","x":524,"y":991,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스로부터","x":678,"y":993,"width":244,"height":38},{"text":"수신하는","x":939,"y":993,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스에게","x":1095,"y":994,"width":211,"height":39},{"text":"데이터가","x":1325,"y":9